WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Approvals. Ask a teammate to approve a task before it can be marked done.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: contracts; design sign-off.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Request approval → The approver is notified → Approve or request changes → The task can be finished

4
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.570
(Note: Milo's decision is made from his own account, off camera.) Pick who should approve…

5
00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:27.610
…and request it.

6
00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:36.700
Until it's approved, the task can't be marked done.

7
00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:46.180
Milo approves — now it can be finished.

8
00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:52.180
I can't mark the task done: It's awaiting approval or changes were requested. Ask the approver, or choose Withdraw request.

9
00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:56.680
One approver per request
